Validate a wrong_answer_report.v1 bundle

Usage:
  eshu report validate [flags]

Flags:
      --from string      Path to a report bundle JSON file; stdin when omitted
  -h, --help             help for validate
      --require-public   Fail if the bundle's redaction profile is not public (share-safe)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
